<title>FRANCE: Sidel Q1 sales jump 47.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Sidel Q1 sales jump 47.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					959.5    vs 649.2</p>
<p>Note - French packaging firm Sidel said in the official bulletin Balo that sales rose 47.8 percent in absolute value and 37.3 percent on a like-for-like basis.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
